	(text "Hierarchy: VBAT_PROT is the only hierarchical connection\n(Power -> LogicPower, ServoPower, Controller). All other signals\nbetween sheets use global labels (Controller GPIO <-> Actuators,\nLighting_IO, ServoPower: SERVO_PWR_EN, P3V3_OK, VSERVO_SENSE,\nISERVO_SENSE, +V_SERVO; Sensors_Display: I2C_SDA, I2C_SCL, IMU_INT1).\n+5V, +3V3, GND are global power symbols."
